    whyItWon: "Full-spectrum emitter sets are still rare at any price, and Sun Home pairs them with a kiln-dried eucalyptus build and a chromotherapy and audio integration that does not feel bolted on. The plug-in install removes the 240V electrician step that kills momentum on most premium sauna purchases.",
