      priceBand: "Budget",
    },
    whyItWon: "Smallest footprint in the lineup that still uses real carbon panels and hemlock construction. Avoids the tent-and-zipper compromises of portable units.",
    tradeoffs: [
      "Solo only",
      "Limited bench depth",
      "Far-only emitters",
